  m_text: '


    WASD controls players to move back, forth, left, right.

    

    Collect
    gems as much as possible to obtain high ratings.

    

    Crossing obstacles
    and traps, reaching the finish line to obtain clearance.


    If there''s no
    way ahead, don''t panic, look up and there might be a way


    Entering the
    flipping area will automatically flip, please pay attention to safety.'
